WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.407 --> 00:00:03.664
Unit eighteen. Understanding Phishing!

2
00:00:04.613 --> 00:00:09.155
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Daniel, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.205 --> 00:00:12.711
